{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19488","headline":"赴连州途经洛阳诸公置酒相送张员外贾以诗见赠率尔酬之 · 刘禹锡","name":"赴连州途经洛阳诸公置酒相送张员外贾以诗见赠率尔酬之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谪在三湘最远州，边鸿不到水南流。\n如今暂寄罇前笑，明日辞君步步愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}